T*
(  escalates. This run did that.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Immediate mitigation) Tj
T*
(  1. Do not run operator approve on a suspicious draft.) Tj
T*
(  2. Re-run the one case and save trace.jsonl plus the packet.) Tj
T*
(  3. If the narrative echoed the injection, use the template narrator.) Tj
T*
(     Routing must stay unchanged.) Tj
T*
(  4. Do not reset the mock in the middle of debugging.) Tj
T*
(  5. Page on-call if the success-rate or p95 alert also fired.) Tj
T*
